{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6406918844c52156","name":"Delta-7 Aethersprite Interceptor","source":{"id":"source:reference-6406918844c52156","title":"Delta-7 Aethersprite Interceptor","revision":18684,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:33:10Z","sha256":"059b45abc8aa545cbb20e840677b53a2ea0b05f140535b6bc516550f5fd1629b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18684","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Delta-7%20Aethersprite%20Interceptor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6406918844c52156","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Kuat Systems Engineering developed the Delta-7 ",{"tag":"i","children":["Aethersprite"]}," when Jedi Master ",{"tag":"a","children":["Saesee Tiin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Saesee_Tiin","referenceId":"reference:70f7698469912309"}," suggested that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," form its own corps of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," pilots. In the time prior to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", these fighters provided an economical- and combat-effective- means for Jedi to get from place to place. Despite its utility, the Delta-7 was distinctly Jedi in nature. For this reason, it was rarely used by Jedi during covert operations.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although the design was well received by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Saesee Tiin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Saesee_Tiin","referenceId":"reference:70f7698469912309"}," was nonetheless dissatisfied with the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Aethersprite"]}," Interceptor's performance. He insisted on modifying two ",{"tag":"i","children":["Aethersprites"]}," to his own specifications, adding additional weaponry, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"}," of his own design, and a meditation chair in place of the pilot's seat. The Delta-7 is available only to Jedi through the Supreme Chancellor's office, and is not legally available on the open market. The prices given are for a Delta-7 found on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Market"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Market"},", which is rare but not unheard of.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The Delta-7 was conceived primarily as a light reconnaissance ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},", and its relatively light armament reflects this. Though not designed for extended combat operations, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Aethersprite"]}," is a capable weapons platform when flown by a Jedi pilot. Like its successor, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Eta-2 ",{"tag":"i","children":["Actis"]}," Interceptor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Eta-2_Actis_Interceptor","referenceId":"reference:6bf84cbdfe0f96c0"},", the Jedi Starfighter is not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"}," capable, and it requires a separate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"}," module to travel long distances.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each ",{"tag":"i","children":["Aethersprite"]}," comes equipped with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["R4-Series Astromech Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/R4-Series_Astromech_Droid","referenceId":"reference:6be48c6629b9afb8"}," (the variant P-Series, which is hardwired directly into the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"). Due to the nonstandard nature of the ship's components, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," takes a -2 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks if the R4-P Droid is not installed. These penalties are also taken by the Droid (if present) and are reflected in the statistics given below.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Expert)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Delta-7 ",{"tag":"i","children":["Aethersprite "]},"Interceptor Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Huge ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +13; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 18 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11)